cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this dataset version and the linked study when reusing Legiscope's original contributions; retain the underlying official source links."
type: dataset
title: "European privacy fines: documented decisions and amounts per resident"
authors:
  - name: Legiscope
version: "2026.10.30.1"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
url: "https://www.legiscope.com/blog/amendes-rgpd-europe-comparaison-pays.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/legiscope/gdpr-data-study"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Frozen collection of 1,042 documented decisions across ten European countries, with source links, coverage notes, known appeal stages, original currencies and per-resident calculations. Data collection as of 25 October 2026; population reference 1 January 2026. Unequal coverage and mixed data-protection regimes preclude a harmonized ranking of national enforcement. CC BY 4.0 applies only to original Legiscope contributions; third-party source rights remain reserved."
keywords:
  - privacy
  - GDPR
  - data protection
  - enforcement
  - open data
